    "reviews": "\u201cA fever-dream dive into the depths\u2014alongside the sinking ocean liner\u2014Titanic 2 is, at the same time, eerily tranquil and profoundly unsettling.\u201d<br>PC Gamer<br><br>\u201cA short, free, moody, silly, serious and incredibly unique game\u201d<br>Games Hub<br><br>\u201cTitanic II: Orchestra for Dying at Sea takes players through a journey into the afterlife and the complicated, snarled feelings that surround death.\u201d<br>Game Developer<br>",
